# trivy/.trivyignore
# Every entry here MUST have a comment explaining why it's accepted, an owner,
# and a review-by date. Unreviewed/expired entries should be removed — this
# file is itself reviewed as part of the quarterly security audit.
#
# Format: CVE-ID  # reason | owner | review-by YYYY-MM-DD
#
# Example (remove once a real exception is needed):
# CVE-2023-00000  # No fix available upstream yet, low exploitability in our context | security-team | 2026-12-31
